---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: AIVANCE — Digitalisierungsagentur Rhein-Main
metaTitle: AIVANCE — Digitalisierungsagentur Rhein-Main
metaDescription: Website, Foto & Video, Software und Automatisierung aus einer Hand. DSGVO-konform, für Praxen, Kanzleien und Gastronomie.
enUrl: /en/
permalink: /
---

<script>
  // Redirects alter Anker-URLs (§ 3): extern verlinkte Anker dürfen nicht ins Leere laufen
  (function () {
    var map = {
      "#features": "/leistungen/",
      "#usecases": "/branchen/",
      "#integrations": "/leistungen/integrationen/",
      "#projects": "/projekte/",
      "#team": "/ueber-uns/",
      "#contact": "/kontakt/"
    };
    var target = map[window.location.hash];
    if (target) window.location.replace(target);
  })();
</script>

<canvas id="bg-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

<!-- ═══ 1 · HERO (§ 6: Agentur-Klammer, Animation bleibt) ═══ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="badge-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Digitalisierungsagentur · {{ site.region }}</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="headline">
      <span>Digitalisierung<br>aus einer Hand.</span>
      <span class="headline-blue">
        <span class="cycling-wrapper" id="cycling-wrapper">
          <span class="cycling-text active">Website.</span>
          <span class="cycling-text">Software.</span>
          <span class="cycling-text">Automatisierung.</span>
          <span class="cycling-text">Ein Partner.</span>
        </span>
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-subtext">
      Website, Bildmaterial, Software und Automatisierung — abgestimmt statt zusammengestückelt. Sie sprechen mit einem Partner statt mit fünf Dienstleistern.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta-row">
      <a href="/kontakt/" class="hero-btn-primary">Kostenloses Erstgespräch</a>
      <a href="/leistungen/" class="hero-btn-secondary">
        Leistungen ansehen <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">3</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Leistungsbereiche</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">4</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Branchen im Fokus</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">1</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Ansprechpartner</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Telefon-Mockup (Bestandsanimation) -->
  <div class="hero-right" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="phone-wrap" style="position:relative;">
      <div class="float-badge float-badge-1" id="hero-badge1">
        <div class="badge-icon green">✓</div>
        <div class="badge-text-group">
          <span class="badge-title">Ein Ansprechpartner</span>
          <span class="badge-sub">statt fünf Dienstleistern</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="float-badge float-badge-2" id="hero-badge2">
        <div class="badge-icon blue">⚡</div>
        <div class="badge-text-group">
          <span class="badge-title">Antwort innerhalb</span>
          <span class="badge-sub">von 24 Stunden</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="phone">
        <div class="phone-inner">
          <div class="notch"></div>
          <div class="status-bar">
            <span>9:41</span>
            <div class="status-icons">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M1 9l2 2c4.97-4.97 13.03-4.97 18 0l2-2C16.93 2.93 7.08 2.93 1 9zm8 8l3 3 3-3c-1.65-1.66-4.34-1.66-6 0zm-4-4l2 2c2.76-2.76 7.24-2.76 10 0l2-2C15.14 9.14 8.87 9.14 5 13z"/></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M15.67 4H14V2h-4v2H8.33C7.6 4 7 4.6 7 5.33v15.33C7 21.4 7.6 22 8.33 22h7.33c.74 0 1.34-.6 1.34-1.33V5.33C17 4.6 16.4 4 15.67 4z"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-header">
            <div class="avatar">A</div>
            <div class="chat-header-info">
              <div class="chat-header-name">AIVANCE</div>
              <div class="online-indicator">
                <span class="online-dot"></span> Online
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-messages" id="hero-chat-messages"></div>
          <div class="chat-input-row">
            <div class="chat-input-bar">Ihre Frage …</div>
            <div class="chat-send">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"/><polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 2 · TRUST-BAR EBENE A (§ 5) ═══ -->
{% include "partials/programme.njk" %}

<!-- ═══ 3 · DAS PROBLEM (§ 6: drei Sätze, kein Feature-Talk) ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 bg-slate-50/50">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 text-center reveal">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Das Problem</p>
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">Fünf Dienstleister,<br/>die nicht miteinander reden.</h2>
    <div class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed space-y-4 max-w-xl mx-auto">
      <p>Der Webdesigner wartet auf Fotos vom Fotografen, die Social-Media-Agentur kennt die neue Leistungsseite nicht, und die IT weiß von allem nichts.</p>
      <p>Koordiniert wird das von Ihnen — abends, zwischen zwei Terminen.</p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Wir lösen das anders: ein Team, ein Ansprechpartner, aufeinander abgestimmte Gewerke.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 4 · DIE DREI CLUSTER (§ 6: ersetzt das Sechser-Feature-Grid) ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Leistungen</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Drei Bereiche,<br/>ein zusammenhängendes System</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      {% for cluster in clusters %}
      <a href="/leistungen/{{ cluster.slug }}/" class="reveal reveal-{{ loop.index }} block bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-7 shadow-card hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl {{ ['bg-blue-50','bg-violet-50','bg-amber-50'][loop.index0] }} flex items-center justify-center mb-5" aria-hidden="true">
          {% if cluster.slug == 'sichtbarkeit' %}
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/></svg>
          {% elif cluster.slug == 'software' %}
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"/></svg>
          {% else %}
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-1">{{ cluster.title }}</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold mb-4">{{ cluster.claim }}</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mb-5">
          {% for punkt in cluster.stichpunkte %}
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            {{ punkt }}
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600">Zum Bereich →</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 5 · DAS AIVANCE-PRINZIP (§ 6/§ 8: drei belegte Säulen) ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Das AIVANCE-Prinzip</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Drei Zusagen —<br/>jede mit Beleg</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <div class="reveal reveal-1 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-7 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Datenschutz</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">Hosting in Deutschland und der EU, AVV nach Art. 28 DSGVO, keine Modelltrainings auf Ihren Daten. Auch für Berufsgeheimnisträger nach § 203 StGB.</p>
        <a href="/datensicherheit/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600">Alle Belege ansehen →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal reveal-2 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-7 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Qualität</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">Referenzen mit Vorher-nachher-Zahlen, ein definierter Prozess mit benannten Phasen und ein fester Ansprechpartner statt „unser Team“.</p>
        <a href="/projekte/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600">Ergebnisse ansehen →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal reveal-3 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-7 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Geschwindigkeit</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">Jede Leistung hat einen eigenen, ehrlichen Zeitrahmen — Wissenssysteme gingen bisher im Schnitt nach 17 Tagen live, eine Website braucht 4–6 Wochen.</p>
        <a href="/leistungen/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600">Zeitrahmen pro Leistung →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 6 · BRANCHEN-SELECTOR (§ 6: wichtigster Klick der Seite) ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Branchen</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Wo arbeiten Sie?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 max-w-md mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Jede Branche hat eigene Abläufe und eigene Regeln. Wählen Sie Ihre — dort zeigen wir nur, was für Sie relevant ist.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
      {% for branche in industries %}
      <a href="/branchen/{{ branche.slug }}/" class="reveal reveal-{{ loop.index }} block bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-6 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-card transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          {% if branche.slug == 'medizin' %}
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
          {% elif branche.slug == 'steuer-finanzberatung' %}
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          {% elif branche.slug == 'gastronomie' %}
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 3v18M3 8h4m10 13V3l4 2v9h-4M7 3v5a2 2 0 104 0V3"/></svg>
          {% else %}
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">{{ branche.title }}</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">{{ branche.heroSatz | truncate(80) }}</p>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600">{{ branche.hero }} →</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 7 · REFERENZEN (§ 6: Teaser mit Zahlen statt leerer Sektion, B6) ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Referenzen</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Echte Ergebnisse<br/>für echte Unternehmen</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-10">
      {% for projekt in projects %}
      <a href="/projekte/{{ projekt.slug }}/" class="reveal reveal-{{ loop.index }} block bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-7 shadow-card hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">{{ projekt.brancheLabel }}</p>
        <p class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900">{{ projekt.teaser.zahl }}</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 font-semibold mb-3">{{ projekt.teaser.zahlLabel }}</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">{{ projekt.teaser.text }}</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600">Zur Case Study →</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="text-center reveal">
      <a href="/projekte/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors">Alle Case Studies ansehen →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 8 · ABLAUF (§ 6: vier Schritte) ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Ablauf</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">So arbeiten wir mit Ihnen</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
      {% set schritte = [
        { nr: "1", titel: "Erstgespräch", text: "Kostenlos und unverbindlich. Wir hören zu, stellen Fragen und sagen Ihnen ehrlich, ob wir helfen können." },
        { nr: "2", titel: "Digital-Audit", text: "Wir schauen uns Website, Abläufe und Systeme an — und beziffern, welcher Schritt am meisten bringt." },
        { nr: "3", titel: "Umsetzung", text: "Ein klar abgegrenzter erster Schritt zum Festpreis, mit Zwischenständen statt Überraschungen." },
        { nr: "4", titel: "Betreuung", text: "Betrieb, Wartung und Weiterentwicklung — mit festem Ansprechpartner und vereinbarten Reaktionszeiten." }
      ] %}
      {% for schritt in schritte %}
      <div class="reveal reveal-{{ loop.index }} relative bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-6">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black mb-4" aria-hidden="true">{{ schritt.nr }}</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">{{ schritt.titel }}</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">{{ schritt.text }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

